{"id":70714,"date":"2026-10-25T19:50:02","date_gmt":"2026-10-25T19:50:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70714"},"modified":"2026-10-25T20:55:25","modified_gmt":"2026-10-25T19:55:25","slug":"hero-challenge-hybrid-simulacao-hyrox","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/hero-challenge-hybrid-simulacao-hyrox\/","title":{"rendered":"Hero Challenge 2027 (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Hero Challenge 2027 (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Hero Challenge 2027 (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>23 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado) no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Gondomar<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Esta competi\u00e7\u00e3o de fitness indoor h\u00edbrido combina o ritmo da corrida com oito esta\u00e7\u00f5es de treino funcional de alta intensidade, desafiando a resist\u00eancia cardiovascular e a for\u00e7a muscular das equipas.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Disputado exclusivamente em formato de duplas (<strong>Double Men<\/strong>, <strong>Double Women<\/strong> e <strong>Double Mixed<\/strong>), o percurso soma <strong>5,6 km de corrida<\/strong> (7 segmentos de 800 metros corridos sempre lado a lado pelos dois elementos) intercalados com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais no sistema <em>You Go, I Go<\/em>: <strong>2000 m BikeErg<\/strong>, <strong>60 m Deadball Bear Crawl<\/strong> (6x10 m), <strong>1000 m SkiErg<\/strong>, <strong>60 m Sled Drag Backwards<\/strong> (150 kg M\/Misto e 110 kg F), <strong>200 m Sandbag Carry<\/strong> (50 kg M\/Misto e 30 kg F), <strong>1000 m RowErg<\/strong>, <strong>100 m Goblet Lunges<\/strong> (22,5 kg M\/Misto e 15 kg F) e <strong>50 Burpees Over Bar<\/strong> (40 cm). O palco do evento, o emblem\u00e1tico Multiusos de Gondomar projetado pelo arquiteto Siza Vieira, situa-se num concelho historicamente reconhecido como a capital da filigrana em Portugal e banhado pelas margens do rio Douro.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o a cargo da <strong>Dotmoovs Lda<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o atribui um <em>prize money<\/em> global de <strong>2.400 \u20ac<\/strong> (500 \u20ac para a 1\u00aa dupla, 200 \u20ac para a 2\u00aa e 100 \u20ac para a 3\u00aa da geral de cada divis\u00e3o), al\u00e9m de distin\u00e7\u00f5es de p\u00f3dio com bandeira HERO para os tr\u00eas primeiros classificados de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio (16\u201329, 30\u201339, 40\u201349, 50\u201359 e +60 anos). Descobre tamb\u00e9m <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/o-que-e-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">o que \u00e9 o HYROX<\/a> e consulta o calend\u00e1rio completo de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Provas HYROX<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">23 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar, Gondomar, Porto<\/span><\/