e:<\/strong> 90,00 \u20ac \/ dupla (45,00 \u20ac \/ atleta)<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 29\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Double Mixed (Duplas Mistas - 7x800m + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 90,00 \u20ac \/ dupla (45,00 \u20ac \/ atleta)<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 29\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Hero Challenge 2027 (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Hero Challenge realiza-se no dia 23 de Janeiro de 2027 (S\u00e1bado), no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar, no concelho de Gondomar, distrito do Porto. As partidas decorrem por s\u00e9ries (heats) consoante a divis\u00e3o atribu\u00edda.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o formato e quais s\u00e3o as 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova disputa-se em duplas (Masculinas, Femininas e Mistas) e combina 7 corridas de 800 metros (total de 5,6 km corridos sempre em conjunto pelos dois atletas) intercaladas por 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es no formato You Go, I Go: 1) 2000m BikeErg, 2) 60m Deadball Bear Crawl, 3) 1000m SkiErg, 4) 60m Sled Drag Backwards (150 kg M\/Misto, 110 kg F), 5) 200m Sandbag Carry (50 kg M\/Misto, 30 kg F), 6) 1000m RowErg, 7) 100m Goblet Lunges (22,5 kg M\/Misto, 15 kg F) e 8) 50 Burpees Over Bar (40 cm).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e onde me posso inscrever?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O valor de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 29 de novembro de 2026 \u00e9 de 45,00 \u20ac por atleta (90,00 \u20ac por dupla). O registo oficial \u00e9 efetuado atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edvel nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais os pr\u00e9mios em disputa?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica no tornozelo (1 por dupla), dorsal e pulseira identificativa da divis\u00e3o, hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o durante a prova, patch oficial, refor\u00e7o alimentar final, dep\u00f3sito de sacos e balne\u00e1rios. H\u00e1 2.400 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios (500 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba lugar, 200 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba e 100 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba de cada categoria), al\u00e9m de p\u00f3dio por escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio (16-29, 30-39, 40-49, 50-59 e +60 anos).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e qual \u00e9 a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Dotmoovs Lda (Dotmoovs Hero). A idade m\u00ednima \u00e9 de 18 anos, sendo permitida a participa\u00e7\u00e3o de jovens a partir dos 16 anos mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o v\u00e1lida dos tutores legais.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Hero Challenge 2027 (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-23\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-23\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar, Gondomar\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Gondomar\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Hero Challenge 2027 (Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox) realiza-se a 23 de janeiro no Multiusos de Gondomar: 5,6 km e 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es em duplas. Consulta esta\u00e7\u00f5es e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-hero-challenge-hybrid-simulacao-hyrox.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Double Men (Duplas Masculinas - 7x800m + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/hero_challenge_gondomar_2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Double Women (Duplas Femininas - 7x800m + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/hero_challenge_gondomar_2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Double Mixed (Duplas Mistas - 7x800m + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/hero_challenge_gondomar_2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Dotmoovs Lda\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Hero Challenge 2027 (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Hero Challenge realiza-se no dia 23 de Janeiro de 2027 (S\u00e1bado), no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Gondomar, no concelho de Gondomar, distrito do Porto. As partidas decorrem por s\u00e9ries (heats) consoante a divis\u00e3o atribu\u00edda.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o formato e quais s\u00e3o as 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova disputa-se em duplas (Masculinas, Femininas e Mistas) e combina 7 corridas de 800 metros (total de 5,6 km corridos sempre em conjunto pelos dois atletas) intercaladas por 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es no formato You Go, I Go: 1) 2000m BikeErg, 2) 60m Deadball Bear Crawl, 3) 1000m SkiErg, 4) 60m Sled Drag Backwards (150 kg M\/Misto, 110 kg F), 5) 200m Sandbag Carry (50 kg M\/Misto, 30 kg F), 6) 1000m RowErg, 7) 100m Goblet Lunges (22,5 kg M\/Misto, 15 kg F) e 8) 50 Burpees Over Bar (40 cm).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e onde me posso inscrever?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O valor de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 29 de novembro de 2026 \u00e9 de 45,00 \u20ac por atleta (90,00 \u20ac por dupla). O registo oficial \u00e9 efetuado atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edvel nesta p\u00e1gina.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais os pr\u00e9mios em disputa?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica no tornozelo (1 por dupla), dorsal e pulseira identificativa da divis\u00e3o, hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o durante a prova, patch oficial, refor\u00e7o alimentar final, dep\u00f3sito de sacos e balne\u00e1rios. H\u00e1 2.400 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios (500 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba lugar, 200 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba e 100 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba de cada categoria), al\u00e9m de p\u00f3dio por escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio (16-29, 30-39, 40-49, 50-59 e +60 anos).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o evento e qual \u00e9 a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Dotmoovs Lda (Dotmoovs Hero). A idade m\u00ednima \u00e9 de 18 anos, sendo permitida a participa\u00e7\u00e3o de jovens a partir dos 16 anos mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o v\u00e1lida dos tutores legais.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70716,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[1455],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-70714","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-gondomar","event_type-hyrox","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-hero-challenge-hybrid-simulacao-hyrox-821x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70714","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href